  "body": "An outstanding opportunity to secure a fully serviced multi-housing development site with building plans, and motivated, supportive landowner ready to work with builders.\r\n\r\nMaster Planned subdivision lead by reputable CKL team finished with Premium infrastructure- Top quality landscape & services, wide streets and access ways.\r\n\r\n57 Sunnyheights Road: \r\n\r\n1887m2 super lot for building 7 standalone homes (Sub Lot 1 - Lot 7)\r\n\r\nFull serviced with Waste water, stormwater, water, power to the each sub lot boundary.\r\n\r\nElevated site with views enjoys a peaceful setting with open surroundings.\r\n\r\nNext to Nukumea Primary School is a rare chance to secure this multiple housing parcel in a high-demand location.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• 1887m2, RC plan for 7 freehold lots for all stand alone houses, fully serviced to each sub lot boundary\r\n\r\n• Lot 1,  332m2 land size, proposed house size 186m2, 4 bedrooms + 2 bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Lot 2-6, 221m2 land size,  proposed house size 231, 4 bedrooms + 2 bedroom studio (2 x kitchens)\r\n\r\n• Lot 7, 450m2 land size, proposed house size 195m2, 4 bedrooms + 2 bathrooms\r\n\r\n•  Next to sought after Nukumea Primary  school and green reserves\r\n\r\nMinutes to Orewa Beach, shops and cafés\r\n\r\nSecure your slice of Orewa and unlock the potential.",
